# Accepted findings of the Trivy scans: one identifier per line, each with a comment that names the owner and the last day (YYYY-MM-DD, at most 90 days ahead).
# Review this file with the daily advisory audit. An empty list is the goal.
#
# Example (not active):
# CVE-2099-00000  # owner: security-administration, until 2099-01-01, no fixed package yet, not reachable from the product
